{% comment %}
  Section: Comparison
  Tableau comparatif entre offres ou produits
  Chaque colonne : titre, sous-titre, prix, mise en avant, bouton, 6 lignes de caracteristiques
  Les libelles des 6 lignes sont definis au niveau de la section
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign bg_color = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background
  assign txt_color = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.text
  assign hl_color = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.primary_button

  assign border_color = txt_color | color_mix: bg_color, 18
  assign head_surface = txt_color | color_mix: bg_color, 5
  assign row_surface = txt_color | color_mix: bg_color, 3
  assign hl_surface = hl_color | color_mix: bg_color, 10
  assign hl_border = hl_color | color_mix: bg_color, 55

  comment
    DEUX surfaces dans la colonne mise en avant, donc DEUX encres. Son en-tete
    (.comparison__col--highlight) est peint en hl_color ; ses cellules
    (.comparison__cell--highlight), son pied et le survol d'une ligne en
    hl_surface, qui est une AUTRE couleur. Une encre se derive sur la surface
    ou elle est posee : derivees sur hl_surface puis posees sur hl_color,
    « Signature », « €59 » et « Our most popular offer » etaient mesures
    #1a1a1a sur #1a1a1a (1:1) sur la demo 1.6.3.
  endcomment
  assign contrast_light = hl_color | color_contrast: '#ffffff'
  assign contrast_dark = hl_color | color_contrast: '#1a1a1a'
  assign on_highlight = '#1a1a1a'
  if contrast_light > contrast_dark
    assign on_highlight = '#ffffff'
  endif
  capture hl_color_text
    render 'contrast-color', base: on_highlight, bg: hl_color
  endcapture
  assign hl_color_text = hl_color_text | strip

  capture hl_surface_text
    render 'contrast-color', base: txt_color, bg: hl_surface
  endcapture
  assign hl_surface_text = hl_surface_text | strip

  comment
    Les deux marques (coche et croix) sont le seul indicateur visuel de la
    ligne, et leurs jetons --color-accent-dark et --color-text-light sont
    derives sur le FOND de la section, pas sur hl_surface ou elles sont
    peintes. On les redérive sur hl_surface.
  endcomment
  assign accent_dark = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.accent | default: '#c9a96e' | color_darken: 22
  capture hl_surface_accent
    render 'contrast-color', base: accent_dark, bg: hl_surface
  endcapture
  assign hl_surface_accent = hl_surface_accent | strip

  comment
    La pastille « recommande » inverse le couple : son aplat est on_highlight
    et son encre hl_color, a 11 px. On releve l'encre sur son propre aplat.
  endcomment
  capture badge_ink
    render 'contrast-color', base: hl_color, bg: on_highlight
  endcapture
  assign badge_ink = badge_ink | strip
-%}

{%- style -%}
  .comparison {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    background-color: {{ bg_color }};
    {% render 'section-tokens', bg: bg_color, text: txt_color, accent: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.accent, scheme: section.settings.color_scheme %}
  }

  .comparison__inner {
    max-width: var(--container-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
  }

  .comparison__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .comparison__pretitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .comparison__title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ txt_color }};
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .comparison__description {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .comparison__scroller {
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    /* UN CONTENEUR DEFILANT NE DOIT JAMAIS IMPOSER LA LARGEUR DE SON CONTENU.
       Mesure 1.6.1 sur /pages/lumiere-all-sections : documentElement.scrollWidth
       665 px pour un ecran de 390, et scrollX 275 apres scrollTo(300,0) a 390,
       300 a 320 et 300 au zoom 400 % — la page defilait vraiment de cote
       (WCAG 1.4.10), malgre html { overflow-x: clip }. Cause isolee en masquant
       les candidats un par un : ce conteneur seul fait retomber scrollWidth a
       390 et scrollX a 0 ; le tableau qu'il porte est force a min-width: 720px
       sous 989 px (plus bas). min-width: 0 neutralise le min-width implicite
       d'un element flex ou grid, max-width: 100% le borne dans tous les cas.
       Ces deux proprietes NE SUFFISENT PAS : mesure 1.7.2 (trois audits, chiffres
       identiques au pixel), le conteneur fait bien clientWidth 342 / scrollWidth
       720, et la fenetre defile quand meme de 275 px. Mesure du correctif, en
       page et sans recharger : forcer ce conteneur en overflow-x: hidden laisse
       665 / 275 (inefficace), tandis que contain: paint le ramene a 390 / 0.
       La containment de peinture est la bonne reponse pour un conteneur
       defilant — rien de son contenu ne doit peindre au-dehors — et elle garde
       le tableau a 720 px, donc lisible, avec son defilement interne ; passer le
       tableau a min-width: 0 corrigerait aussi la mesure mais ecraserait les
       colonnes sous 989 px. */
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    contain: paint;
    /* UN ARRET DE TABULATION ENTRE EN ENTIER. Quand le navigateur amene de
       lui-meme un element focalise dans cette zone, il s'arrete des que
       l'element touche le bord : a 390 et 320, 2 a 3 arrets du tableau
       n'etaient visibles qu'a 33-67 % une fois focalises (audit
       d'accessibilite 1.8.1 ; WCAG 2.4.11 tenu, 2.4.12 non). Le defilement
       reserve donc une gouttiere de chaque cote, de la largeur de la marge
       des cellules. */
    scroll-padding-inline: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  /* L'ANNEAU RENTRE, PARCE QUE LA ZONE ROGNE CE QUI DEPASSE. Cette zone porte
     « contain: paint » (voir plus haut) : un anneau pose a 2 px A L'EXTERIEUR
     du bouton est rogne au bord de la zone, et il n'en reste pas assez pour
     etre mesure — 2 releves sur le bouton de la colonne mise en avant (mesure
     du theme d'essai). On le rentre dans le bouton, comme le fait deja le
     theme pour les boutons poses sur une image. */
  .comparison__scroller :where(a, button):focus-visible {
    outline-offset: -3px;
  }

  /* La zone elle-meme est un arret de tabulation (tabindex 0, pour defiler au
     clavier) et occupe toute la largeur a 320 : un anneau pose a l'exterieur
     sortait de la fenetre (1 anneau non mesurable a 320, audit d'accessibilite
     1.8.1). Il est rentre dans la zone. */
  .comparison__scroller:focus-visible {
    outline-offset: -2px;
  }


  .comparison__table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    color: {{ txt_color }};
  }

  .comparison__corner {
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
  }

  .comparison__col {
    vertical-align: bottom;
    width: 22%;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-sm);
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 400;
    background-color: {{ head_surface }};
    border: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
    border-bottom-width: 2px;
  }

  .comparison__col--highlight {
    background-color: {{ hl_color }};
    color: {{ on_highlight }};
    border-color: {{ hl_border }};
  }

  .comparison__badge {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background-color: {{ on_highlight }};
    color: {{ badge_ink }};
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .comparison__col-title {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .comparison__col-subtitle {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    /* opacity 0.75 donnait 4,18:1 en variante accent : couleur deduite */
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .comparison__col--highlight .comparison__col-title,
  .comparison__col--highlight .comparison__col-subtitle,
  .comparison__col--highlight .comparison__col-price {
    color: {{ hl_color_text }};
  }

  .comparison__cell--highlight .comparison__detail {
    color: {{ hl_surface_text }};
  }

  .comparison__col-price {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .comparison__row-header {
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-sm) 0;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
  }

  .comparison__cell {
    padding: var(--spacing-sm);
    text-align: center;
    vertical-align: middle;
    border-left: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
    border-right: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
  }

  .comparison__table tbody tr:nth-child(even) .comparison__cell,
  .comparison__table tbody tr:nth-child(even) .comparison__row-header {
    background-color: {{ row_surface }};
  }

  .comparison__cell--highlight,
  .comparison__table tbody tr:nth-child(even) .comparison__cell--highlight {
    background-color: {{ hl_surface }};
    border-left-color: {{ hl_border }};
    border-right-color: {{ hl_border }};
  }

  .comparison__mark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .comparison__mark .icon {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .comparison__mark--yes {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
  }

  .comparison__mark--no {
    /* SEUL indicateur visuel de « non inclus » (le texte qui le double est
       visually-hidden) : a opacity 0.35 l'encre composee valait 2,20:1 pour un
       seuil de 3:1. On garde la nuance discrete par un jeton derive. */
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  /* Les deux jetons ci-dessus sont derives sur le fond de la section. Dans une
     cellule mise en avant, la marque est peinte sur hl_surface : on y pose des
     encres derivees sur hl_surface. */
  .comparison__cell--highlight .comparison__mark--yes {
    color: {{ hl_surface_accent }};
  }

  .comparison__cell--highlight .comparison__mark--no {
    color: {{ hl_surface_text }};
  }

  .comparison__detail {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    /* opacity 0.8 donnait 4,34:1 en variante accent */
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .comparison__foot-cell {
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-sm);
    text-align: center;
    border-left: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
    border-right: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ border_color }};
  }

  .comparison__foot-cell--highlight {
    background-color: {{ hl_surface }};
    border-left-color: {{ hl_border }};
    border-right-color: {{ hl_border }};
    border-bottom-color: {{ hl_border }};
  }

  .comparison__button {
    width: 100%;
    padding-left: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-right: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .comparison__note {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    /* Couleur derivee a 4,6:1 au lieu d'une opacite de 0,6, qui mettait la
       note a 4,48:1. */
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .comparison__table tbody tr:hover .comparison__row-header,
    .comparison__table tbody tr:hover .comparison__cell {
      background-color: {{ head_surface }};
    }

    .comparison__table tbody tr:hover .comparison__cell--highlight {
      background-color: {{ hl_surface }};
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .comparison__table {
      min-width: 720px;
    }

    .comparison__col-title {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }

    .comparison__col-price {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .comparison__header {
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .comparison__row-header,
    .comparison__cell {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- liquid
  assign column_count = 0
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'column'
      assign column_count = column_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  assign has_footer = false
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'column' and block.settings.button_label != blank and block.settings.button_link != blank
      assign has_footer = true
    endif
  endfor

  assign scroller_label = 'sections.comparison.scroller_label' | t
  assign table_caption = 'sections.comparison.table_caption' | t
  assign features_column = 'sections.comparison.features_column' | t
  assign included_label = 'sections.comparison.included' | t
  assign not_included_label = 'sections.comparison.not_included' | t
  assign recommended_label = 'sections.comparison.recommended' | t
  assign actions_label = 'sections.comparison.actions' | t
-%}

<div class="comparison color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="comparison__inner">
    {%- if section.settings.pretitle != blank or section.settings.title != blank or section.settings.description != blank -%}
      <div class="comparison__header">
        {%- if section.settings.pretitle != blank -%}
          <p class="comparison__pretitle">{{ section.settings.pretitle | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
          <h2 class="comparison__title">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.description != blank -%}
          <p class="comparison__description">{{ section.settings.description | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if column_count > 0 -%}
      <div class="comparison__scroller" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="{{ scroller_label }}">
        <table class="comparison__table">
          <caption class="visually-hidden">{{ table_caption }}</caption>

          <thead>
            <tr>
              <td class="comparison__corner">
                <span class="visually-hidden">{{ features_column }}</span>
              </td>

              {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                {%- if block.type == 'column' -%}
                  <th
                    scope="col"
                    class="comparison__col{% if block.settings.highlight %} comparison__col--highlight{% endif %}"
                    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                  >
                    {%- if block.settings.highlight -%}
                      <span class="comparison__badge">{{ recommended_label }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}

                    {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
                      <span class="comparison__col-title">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}

                    {%- if block.settings.subtitle != blank -%}
                      <span class="comparison__col-subtitle">{{ block.settings.subtitle | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}

                    {%- if block.settings.price != blank -%}
                      <span class="comparison__col-price">{{ block.settings.price | escape }}</span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </th>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </tr>
          </thead>

          <tbody>
            {%- for i in (1..6) -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign label_key = 'row_label_' | append: i
                assign row_label = section.settings[label_key]
                assign feature_key = 'feature_' | append: i
                assign has_key = 'has_' | append: i
              -%}

              {%- if row_label != blank -%}
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row" class="comparison__row-header">{{ row_label | escape }}</th>

                  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                    {%- if block.type == 'column' -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign cell_detail = block.settings[feature_key]
                        assign cell_has = block.settings[has_key]
                      -%}
                      <td class="comparison__cell{% if block.settings.highlight %} comparison__cell--highlight{% endif %}">
                        {%- if cell_has -%}
                          <span class="comparison__mark comparison__mark--yes">
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ included_label }}</span>
                            {% render 'icon', icon: 'check' %}
                          </span>
                        {%- else -%}
                          <span class="comparison__mark comparison__mark--no">
                            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ not_included_label }}</span>
                            {% render 'icon', icon: 'close' %}
                          </span>
                        {%- endif -%}

                        {%- if cell_detail != blank -%}
                          <span class="comparison__detail">{{ cell_detail | escape }}</span>
                        {%- endif -%}
                      </td>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </tr>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </tbody>

          {%- if has_footer -%}
            <tfoot>
              <tr>
                <td class="comparison__corner">
                  <span class="visually-hidden">{{ actions_label }}</span>
                </td>

                {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                  {%- if block.type == 'column' -%}
                    <td class="comparison__foot-cell{% if block.settings.highlight %} comparison__foot-cell--highlight{% endif %}">
                      {%- if block.settings.button_label != blank and block.settings.button_link != blank -%}
                        {%- liquid
                          assign button_class = 'btn btn--secondary comparison__button'
                          if block.settings.highlight
                            assign button_class = 'btn btn--primary comparison__button'
                          endif
                        -%}
                        <a class="{{ button_class }}" href="{% render 'lien-localise', url: block.settings.button_link %}">
                          {{- block.settings.button_label | escape -}}
                          {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
                            <span class="visually-hidden"> {{ block.settings.title | escape }}</span>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </a>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </td>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </tr>
            </tfoot>
          {%- endif -%}
        </table>
      </div>

      {%- if section.settings.note != blank -%}
        <p class="comparison__note">{{ section.settings.note | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.comparison.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-comparison",
  "max_blocks": 4,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.comparison.settings.header__1.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pretitle",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.pretitle.label",
      "default": "Our plans"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.title.label",
      "default": "Compare our plans"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.description.label",
      "default": "Three plans, one standard. Compare what each includes and pick the one that fits you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "note",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.note.label",
      "info": "t:sections.comparison.settings.note.info",
      "default": "Tax included. Cancel any time."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.comparison.settings.header__2.content",
      "info": "t:sections.comparison.settings.header__2.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_label_1",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.row_label_1.label",
      "default": "Delivery options"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_label_2",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.row_label_2.label",
      "default": "Gift wrapping"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_label_3",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.row_label_3.label",
      "default": "Access to private sales"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_label_4",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.row_label_4.label",
      "default": "Complimentary personalisation"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_label_5",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.row_label_5.label",
      "default": "Priority customer service"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "row_label_6",
      "label": "t:sections.comparison.settings.row_label_6.label",
      "default": "Repair service"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.comparison.settings.header__3.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:settings_schema.couleurs.settings.color_scheme.label",
      "info": "t:settings_schema.couleurs.settings.color_scheme.info",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "column",
      "name": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.title.label",
          "default": "Essential"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "subtitle",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.subtitle.label",
          "default": "A first taste of the house"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "price",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.price.label",
          "info": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.price.info",
          "default": "Your price"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "highlight",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.highlight.label",
          "info": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.highlight.info",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "button_label",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.button_label.label",
          "default": "Choose this plan"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "button_link",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.button_link.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "content": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.header__1.content",
          "info": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.header__1.info"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "has_1",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.has_1.label",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "feature_1",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.feature_1.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "has_2",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.has_2.label",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "feature_2",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.feature_2.label"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "has_3",
          "label": "t:sections.comparison.blocks.column.settings.has_3.label",
          "default": false
        },
        {
